║  Precision = TP/(TP+FP)                   ║
║  "When I say fraud, am I right?"          ║
║  Goal: Minimize false alarms              ║
║                                            ║
║  Recall = TP/(TP+FN)                      ║
║  "How much fraud am I catching?"          ║
║  Goal: Minimize missed fraud              ║
║                                            ║
║  ROC-AUC = Area under ROC curve           ║
║  "How good is my model overall?"          ║
║  Goal: > 0.85 is good, > 0.90 is great   ║
║                                            ║
║  F1 = 2 × (Precision × Recall)            ║
║      / (Precision + Recall)               ║
║  "Balanced score"                         ║
